.TH REBUILD-CHECK 1 "November 2026" "rebuild-check-hook 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rebuild-check \- Consolidates rebuild-detector and anneal hooks to trigger package rebuilds
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rebuild-check
[\fIPACKAGES\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rebuild-check
is an automated utility and libalpm post-transaction hook for Arch Linux.
It inspects updated shared libraries and binaries, queries \fBrebuild-detector\fR and \fBanneal\fR, and marks or rebuilds dependent AUR/custom packages against newly installed libraries.
.SH OPTIONS
Accepts package names via standard input or arguments when invoked during pacman/paru post-transaction processing.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR checkrebuild (1),
.BR paru (8),
.BR pacman (8)
.SH AUTHORS
Maintained by Vikyek <https://github.com/Vikyek/rebuild-check-hook>.
